# Constraint
This is a timed technical challenge.

# Rules
- Use architecture to improve clarity, not to impress with ceremony.
- Do not add extra ports, adapters, wrappers, factories, or interfaces unless they improve testability or boundary clarity.
- Prefer one clear application service per use case over deep call chains.
- Prefer explicit code over clever code.
- Keep microservice boundaries real and visible.
- Keep the solution easy to explain in under 10 minutes.

# Important
A senior solution is not the most abstract solution.
A senior solution is the clearest correct solution with sound tradeoffs.